nal laugh fades naturally, leaving only the campfire and forest ambience.\n\noverall_soundscape:\nContinuous campfire crackle, light wind through pine trees, occasional\ninsects, and distant nocturnal birds are audible throughout the entire\nclip, beneath all speech, and never fully stop. Voices remain clear,\ncrisp, and forward in the mix above the ambience. Natural pauses,\nbreaths, and group laughter accompany the dialogue.\n\nnon_diegetic_music:\nN/A"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "id": 174, "type": "JjkText", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "JjkText"}, "order": 10}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}], "size": [735.8583374023438, 274.6294860839844], "pos": [1727.639892578125, 4372.9755859375], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "audio", "link": 338, "label": "audio", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "audio"}, {"widget": {"name": "audioUI"}, "name": "audioUI", "label": "audioUI", "type": "AUDIO_UI", "localized_name": "audioUI"}], "flags": {}, "id": 173, "type": "PreviewAudio", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewAudio"}, "order": 20}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "AUDIO", "links": [337, 338, 369], "label": "AUDIO", "type": "AUDIO", "localized_name": "AUDIO"}], "size": [230, 60], "pos": [1106.3197021484375, 4599.7900390625], "widgets_values": [], "inputs": [{"name": "samples", "link": 248, "label": "samples", "type": "LATENT", "localized_name": "samples"}, {"name": "vae", "link": 228, "label": "vae", "type": "VAE", "localized_name": "vae"}], "flags": {"collapsed": false}, "id": 121, "type": "VAEDecodeAudio", "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "ver": "0.30.0", "widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "VAEDecodeAudio"}, "order": 18}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "audio", "label": "audio", "type": 